      "title": "Dumb and Dumber movie review & film summary - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "The plot is lame, but that doesn't matter, because \"Dumb and Dumber\" is essentially pitched at the level of an \"Airplane!\"-style movie, with rapid-fire sight gags. Some of them work, like the karate fight that ends with a guy getting his heart handed to him in a doggie bag.",
