      "title": "Dumb and Dumber - Wikipedia",
      "snippet": "Critical response Rotten Tomatoes, a review aggregator, reports that 69% of 54 surveyed critics gave Dumb and Dumber a positive review. The site's consensus reads: \"A relentlessly stupid comedy elevated by its main actors: Jim Carrey goes bonkers and Jeff Daniels carries himself admirably in an against-type performance\". [28]",
